Rule 3 (if input is complex, out must not be bool to avoid illegal cast)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if 9 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10 then dtype_(v_2) ≠ 0
